  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-116196",
  "summary": "Rclone before v1.75.2 B2 Credential Leak on Redirect via --b2-download-url",
  "details": "Rclone before v1.75.2 contains a credential exposure vulnerability in the b2 backend that leaks the live account Authorization token and SSE-C keys on HTTP redirects from --b2-download-url hosts. Attackers can observe a same-host HTTPS-to-HTTP downgrade redirect to capture the cleartext B2 token, or receive cross-host redirects disclosing SSE-C customer encryption keys.",
